  "assumptions": [
   "Sample about 4,400 per arm (about 22,000 total) to detect 0.06 at 80% power with SD about 0.9 at alpha 0.05; this is expensive, so a covariate-adjusted analysis on pre-trust could reduce the requirement.",
   "Panel: a vendor other than Lucid (e.g., Prolific or a probability panel); compensation per vendor norms.",
   "Three directional tests are pre-registered with Holm correction; interactions are secondary.",
   "Low vs high baseline trust is split at the sample median of pre-treatment trust.",
   "Each student video is given a title and content coding (e.g., tone, narrator, topic, length) by two blind coders to link features to effects."
  ],
